[112.760162, "o", "\u001b[33mWarning: create-tsrouter-app is deprecated. Use \"tanstack create --router-only\" or \"npx @tanstack/cli create --router-only\" instead.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m         This defaults to router-only compatibility mode (file-based routing, no Start-specific add-ons).\r\n\u001b[0m\r\nTanStack CLI sends anonymous usage telemetry by default. It never sends project names, paths, raw search text, template URLs, add-on config values, or raw error messages. Disable it with `tanstack telemetry disable` or `TANSTACK_CLI_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1`.\r\n┌  Creating a new TanStack app in myapp-test...\r\n\u001b[?25l│\r\n◇  Initialized git repository\r\n\u001b[?25h\u001b[?25l│\r\n◇  Dependency installation skipped\r\n\u001b[?25h\u001b[?25l│\r\n◒  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings\u001b[999D\u001b[J◐  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings\u001b[999D\u001b[J◓  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings\u001b[999D\u001b[J◑  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings\u001b[999D\u001b[J◒  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings\u001b[999D\u001b[J◐  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings\u001b[999D\u001b[J◓  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings\u001b[999D\u001b[J◑  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings\u001b[999D\u001b[J◒  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings.\u001b[999D\u001b[J◐  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings.\u001b[999D\u001b[J◓  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings.\u001b[999D\u001b[J◑  Setting up TanStack Intent skill mappings.\u001b[999D\u001b[J◇  TanStack Intent configured\r\n\u001b[?25h│\r\n└  Your TanStack app is ready in 'myapp-test'.\r\n\r\nUse the following commands to start your app:\r\n% cd myapp-test\r\n% npm run dev\r\n\r\nNext steps:\r\n\r\nWorking with an AI agent? Your agent config (AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md) was wired up by TanStack Intent\r\nwith explicit skill mappings for the libraries you installed. Try asking your agent:\r\n  • \"migrate this Next.js page to TanStack Start\"\r\n  • \"add a protected /dashboard route\"\r\n  • \"show me how to use TanStack Router search params\"\r\n\r\nPlease read the README.md file for information on testing, styling, adding routes, etc.\r\n\r\n"]
